      <string>One application per line:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Name | window class | title | shortcut&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Window class and title are case-insensitive substring matches; leave either empty to skip it. The shortcut only applies the first time an entry is registered — after that, change it in Shortcuts → KWin. Lines starting with # are ignored.</string>
